      "name": "1-High Explosive Sheep",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The gan'arg releases a mechanized sheep into an unoccupied space within 5 feet of it. the sheep has a walking speed of 20 feet, AC 10, 1 hit point, and no effective attacks. It rolls initiative, and on its turn, moves toward the closest creature, preferably toward a group of creature. It then proceeds to explode, forcing all creatures within 10 feet of it to make a DC 13 Dexterity saving throw, taking 1d6 fire damage and being knocked prone on a failed save, or half as much damage and no other ill effect on a success.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
